---
const title = "冰箱里的世界";
const description = "会员邀请制 · 私密阅读空间";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      
      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #faf9f7;
        color: #333;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      
      .container {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 1.5rem;
      }
      
      header {
        padding: 1.5rem 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
      }
      
      .logo {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #222;
      }
      
      .hero {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 5rem 0 3rem;
      }
      
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        color: #1a1a1a;
      }
      
      .hero p {
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        color: #666;
      }
      
      .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #1a1a1a;
        color: #fff;
        padding: 0.375rem 1rem;
        border-radius: 100px;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
      }
      
      .content-area {
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 3rem 2rem;
        text-align: center;
        margin: 2rem 0 4rem;
      }
      
      .lock-icon {
        font-size: 3rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      
      .content-area h2 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        color: #1a1a1a;
      }
      
      .content-area p {
        color: #666;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      }
      
      .hint {
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        color: #999;
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
      }
      
      footer {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 2rem 0;
        border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
        color: #999;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="container">
      <span class="logo">📚 {title}</span>
    </header>
    
    <main class="container">
      <div class="hero">
        <h1>欢迎来到{title}</h1>
        <p>这是一个私密的阅读空间，只有受邀会员才能访问</p>
        <span class="badge">🔒 邀请制</span>
      </div>
      
      <div class="content-area">
        <div class="lock-icon">📖</div>
        <h2>内容区域</h2>
        <p>登录后可阅读完整小说内容</p>
        <p class="hint">此区域受邀请码保护<br>未受邀用户无法访问</p>
      </div>
    </main>
    
    <footer>
      <div class="container">
        <p>© 2026 {title} · 仅供会员阅读</p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>